00:54:53.264 --> 00:54:58.905
politically, socially in ways that we could construct new

1142
00:54:58.905 --> 00:55:03.225
needs and in our needs that, I mean, even

1143
00:55:03.225 --> 00:55:05.655
if you want to put it in those terms,

1144
00:55:05.985 --> 00:55:09.024
that would be better for us.

1145
00:55:09.590 --> 00:55:11.540
Hm, yeah, and, and, and, and yeah, we, we,

