00:55:11.590 --> 00:55:13.270
we could probably have another hour on what better

1147
00:55:13.270 --> 00:55:14.399
means. Uh

1148
00:55:14.399 --> 00:55:17.030
YEAH, sure, that, that's what, that's the reason why

1149
00:55:17.030 --> 00:55:19.030
I said if you want to put it in

1150
00:55:19.030 --> 00:55:19.800
those terms,

